{"ts": "2025-12-14T06:30:55.976936Z", "level": "INFO", "event": "TASK.TRADE.PROCESSING", "event_code": "TASK.TRADE.PROCESSING", "trace_id": "TRC-20251214063055-e3a670d7452f", "service": "task_manager", "msg": "处理TRADE阶段任务", "extra": {"task_id": 639, "metadata": {"market": {"id": "916398", "question": "Will Stephanie Linnartz be the next CEO of Lululemon?", "slug": "will-stephanie-linnartz-be-the-next-ceo-of-lululemon", "outcomes": "[\"Yes\", \"No\"]", "outcome_prices": "[\"0.075\", \"0.925\"]", "active": true, "volume": "81.13558", "liquidity": "43.4689", "end_date": "2026-12-31T00:00:00Z", "tau": 381, "tags": [], "marks": [], "negRisk": true, "clobTokenIds": "[\"47564254937845529357591208560029581523106011539447646669830917148538251710337\", \"13828625754071196895785112992660050892933194847175325390167797184561389731150\"]"}, "analysis": {"p": 0.04, "n": 0.96, "a": 0.8, "reasons_y": ["She has prior CEO experience at Under Armour and a long executive history at Marriott, giving her a mix of athletic-apparel and global consumer-brand expertise. citeturn1search2turn1search11turn1search16", "Lululemon faces a turnaround situation similar to Under Armour’s earlier challenges, which may make someone who has led such efforts attractive. citeturn1news56turn1news58", "An external hire with high-profile public company experience can signal a decisive reset to investors and critics."], "reasons_n": ["Her Under Armour tenure ended early with the founder returning to the CEO role, which could raise board concerns about fit or execution. citeturn1search6turn1search16", "There is no public reporting linking her specifically to Lululemon’s search, unlike the clearly identified internal interim co-CEOs. citeturn1search0turn1search18", "Given strong scrutiny from founder Chip Wilson and investors, the board may prefer a candidate without such recent, highly visible mixed results. citeturn0news64turn1news55turn1news56"]}, "source_analysis_task_id": 631, "marks": []}, "result": {"decision": "skip", "reason": "根据Kelly准则，当前市场不值得交易", "wealth": 100.0}}}
